  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed both for casual recreational riding and competitive equestrian sports. Can function as a verbal noun with する: {乗馬|じょうば}する (to ride a horse). Also used as a modifier: {乗馬|じょうば}クラブ (riding club), {乗馬|じょうば}{体験|たいけん} (riding experience).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {乗馬|じょうば}クラブ (riding club)\n- {乗馬|じょうば}{体験|たいけん} (horse riding experience)\n- {乗馬|じょうば}する (to ride a horse)\n- {乗馬|じょうば}{教室|きょうしつ} (riding school)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {騎馬|きば}: horseback, mounted — more historical/military\n- {馬術|ばじゅつ}: horsemanship, equestrian art — competitive/technical term",
